    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 6104 recorded a gross release on prior-year claims of $12.195m in 2022 (an ~11.1% reduction versus opening gross claims outstanding of $110.335m). The movement is reported in the technical provisions reconciliation as an \"Over-provision in respect of prior claims and claim adjustment expenses (12,195)\" and reflects favourable prior-year claims development, driven largely by releases on prior catastrophe exposures (Typhoon Faxai, Typhoon Hagibis, Typhoon Jebi, Hurricane Ida and various US tornado events) and developments in Covid-19 related reserves and reinsurance recoveries. The syndicate is a pure reinsurance vehicle and the prior-year release is reflected against its retained treaty exposures.",
